# Zhou3: Sabidussi coset graph

The **Zhou-3 graph** (F182A, 182 vertices, cubic) is Sab(PSL(2,13), S₃).
|PSL(2,13)| = 1092, |S₃| = 6, 1092/6 = 182 vertices.
-/

